     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Please try:<div><br></div><div><div># title: cut應用</div><div># date: 2018.5.29</div><div><br></div><div>set.seed(123)</div><div>x &lt;- sample(80, 10, replace = TRUE)</div><div>x</div><div><br></div><div>x1.level &lt;- cut(x,breaks = c(0,15,64,100))</div><div>x1.level</div><div><br></div><div>x2.level &lt;- cut(x,breaks = c(0,15,64,100), labels=c(&quot;少年&quot;, &quot;青年&quot;, &quot;壯年&quot;))</div><div>x2.level</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Q38q0g8D_Ng/Ww0NroouGJI/AAAAAAAASCc/d2RZnI_J-G4OVI_7ZBnc1nNbupkOBBcXgCLcBGAs/s1600/cut%25E6%2587%2589%25E7%2594%25A8.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Q38q0g8D_Ng/Ww0NroouGJI/AAAAAAAASCc/d2RZnI_J-G4OVI_7ZBnc1nNbupkOBBcXgCLcBGAs/s1600/cut%2525E6%252587%252589%2525E7%252594%2525A8.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237459657000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2YWv2ZkSpt2a6YRzKbohJt\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Q38q0g8D_Ng/Ww0NroouGJI/AAAAAAAASCc/d2RZnI_J-G4OVI_7ZBnc1nNbupkOBBcXgCLcBGAs/s400/cut%25E6%2587%2589%25E7%2594%25A8.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"152\"></a></p><div><br></div><br>吳伯俊於 2018年5月29日星期二 UTC+8下午1時55分37秒寫道：</div></div>"
